{"id":71332,"date":"2026-10-29T19:27:09","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:27:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71332"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:28:59","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:28:59","slug":"night-running-santiago-do-cacem","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/night-running-santiago-do-cacem\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00ba Night Running Santiago do Cac\u00e9m 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00ba Night Running Santiago do Cac\u00e9m 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>8\u00ba Night Running Santiago do Cac\u00e9m 2027<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>13 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), em <strong>Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>, com hor\u00e1rio na plataforma oficial registado \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>. Este evento emblem\u00e1tico do Litoral Alentejano junta o pelot\u00e3o competitivo, fam\u00edlias e escal\u00f5es jovens num dia de desporto e conv\u00edvio.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo integra tr\u00eas vertentes: a <strong>Corrida principal de 14 km<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> e as <strong>Corridas Kids<\/strong> destinadas aos mais novos. Os tra\u00e7ados percorrem o n\u00facleo hist\u00f3rico de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m e a sua envolvente natural, marcada pela silhueta imponente do Castelo medieval, da Igreja Matriz de Santiago e da proximidade \u00e0s ru\u00ednas romanas de Mir\u00f3briga. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; f